description: POP Events detail URLs use singular /venue and /event (not plurals)
alwaysApply: true
---

# Detail page URL paths (singular)

When telling the user which localhost pages to check, or linking event/venue detail pages:

- **Venue detail:** `/en/venue/{slug}` — never `/en/venues/{slug}`
- **Event detail:** `/en/event/{id}` — never `/en/events/{id}`

Same for `/es` and `/fr`.

Listing/index routes stay plural (`/en/venues`, `/en/events`). Static asset folders (`public/venues/`, `public/events/`) are unrelated and keep their plural names.
